{"id":148042570135842,"type":"artist","name":"Jade Warrior","artist":null,"year":1970,"weight":18,"info":{"tags":["Progressive rock","Psychedelic Rock","psychedelic","70s","rock"],"country":"GB","begin":"1970","kind":"Group","similar":["Gravy Train","Audience","Caravan","Cressida","Fruupp","Greenslade","Embryo","Gong","Curved Air","Beggars Opera"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Jade_Warrior_group.jpg?width=500","bio":"JADE WARRIOR se formó a finales de los '60 por Glyn HAVARD, Tony DUHIG, Jon FIELD, Alan PRICE, y David DUHIG, con una concepción bastante original. Nunca hicieron una música específica y es seguramente la razón por la que no se le escuchaba en radio, ni se le veía en listas de popularidad, ni los producía una etiqueta cuyo portafolios incluyera nombres conocidos. Desde que iniciaron contemplaron una idea propia, muy difícil de catalogar."},"works":[{"id":39836791197759,"type":"album","name":"Jade Warrior","artist":"Jade Warrior","year":1971,"weight":3,"yt":"4pxNycZUqPY","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":168830959364793,"name":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — English Underground","rank":119,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":268520008975672,"type":"album","name":"Last Autumn's Dream","artist":"Jade Warrior","year":1972,"weight":14,"yt":"17xn_-N874w","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":337,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":250811068398268,"type":"album","name":"Waves","artist":"Jade Warrior","year":1975,"weight":15,"yt":"LVwfBvVU1HI","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":103,"scaruffi":7.5}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":179730259264021,"type":"album","name":"Kites","artist